# VID-02 — Don't autoplay with sound

## Rationale

Autoplay with audio is disallowed by browsers; autoplay requires `muted` and
usually `playsinline`.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check video <file>
```

## How to fix

Propose adding both `muted` and `playsinline` to the autoplaying `<video>`.
